# Purpose

The Apple TV Module enables Aura to interact with Apple TV as naturally as any Apple application while respecting Apple's platform limitations.

Aura should never attempt to replace tvOS.

Instead, Aura complements the Apple TV experience.

---

# Design Goals

Native

Reliable

Private

Fast

Predictable

Battery Efficient

---

# Responsibilities

The module shall:

• Discover Apple TVs
• Authenticate securely
• Read playback status
• Wake and sleep Apple TV
• Send remote commands
• Synchronize playback state
• Report diagnostics

