# Security

Authentication credentials are stored only in Keychain.

No user media history is transmitted externally.

Local communication is preferred whenever possible.

---

# Privacy

Aura never uploads viewing history.

Aura never tracks watched content.

User activity remains local.

---

# Performance Targets

Discovery

<5 seconds

